OL,3,GNEWSAHomeless people 'cautious and
OL,4,Asceptical' of PM pledge
OL,5,
OL,6,FHomeless people have expressed mixed
OL,7,Ffeelings over the prime minister's
OL,8,Fpledge to get rough sleepers off the
OL,9,Fstreets for Christmas.
OL,11,FTheir experiences of rough sleeping in
OL,12,FBoscombe, Dorset, included living in a
OL,13,Fderelict building, being attacked while
OL,14,Fasleep, and sleeping on the beach.
OL,16,FAndy Burnham has promised to "end
OL,17,Flong-term rough sleeping" and has said
OL,18,Fevery rough sleeper in England would be
OL,19,Foffered accommodation this winter.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,334,330,200,160,0,100
