OL,3,GNEWSAHomeless people 'cautious and
OL,4,Asceptical' of PM pledge
OL,5,
OL,6,FRough sleeper Stuart Hopwood said for
OL,7,Fhim "security" was his main worry,
OL,8,Fadding: "I've been attacked when I've
OL,9,Fbeen asleep a couple of times."
